      "role": "user",
      "content": "The engineering part feels a bit too blunt for what i need. The board is really sensitive to turnover right now. Is there a way to frame that engineering number more as a normal part of the cycle rather than a spike? Just something that minimizes the alarm bells while staying professional.",
